---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Is Poland Safe Now?"
  description="About Is Poland Safe Now?, an independent information service tracking regional security-alert exposure across Poland."
  path="/about"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8 text-slate-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About</h1>
    <p>
      Is Poland Safe Now? is an independent information service that summarizes publicly reported developments
      relevant to Poland's regional security situation — including the Russia-Ukraine war, Belarus border activity,
      Kaliningrad, airspace violations, drone or missile incidents, RCB warnings, and border, airport, or transport
      disruptions — organized by voivodeship.
    </p>
    <p>
      It is not affiliated with the Polish government, RCB, or any emergency service, and it is not an official
      warning system. It cannot guarantee safety. Always follow instructions from Polish authorities. For
      emergencies, call 112.
    </p>
    <p>
      This build is an early foundation: an interactive map, homepage, region pages, and a public API, all backed by
      clearly labeled demonstration data. See the <a class="underline" href="/methodology">methodology page</a> for
      details on what is implemented today and what is planned.
    </p>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
